<script>
/* =====================================================================
   STATION MASTER DATA
   Parameters, environment, costs and quality criteria are taken from the
   PEM RWTH Aachen process guide, one entry per station page.
   `parts` indices line up with the hotspot data-k values in the machine.
   ===================================================================== */
